<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Disney EPS view cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Disney EPS view cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney trimmed its earnings estimate on Walt Disney Co to $2.73 a share from $2.75 a share in 1997 and to $3.12 a share from $3.15 a share for 1998, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Disney gained 1/16 to 80 in morning trading.</p>
</text>
